The AI can change a printer's hardware and compatibility settings
The settings tools refused 51 settings. They now refuse 14: the one that
runs a program when G-code is exported (post_process), and the 13 that say
where a printer is on the network and how to sign in to it. The 37 others
are writable like any setting: the printer's hardware (bed size, nozzle,
extruders, model) and the settings that record which preset this is, what
it inherits from and what it fits.

Kenneth, 2026-11-21: "let's keep the first 2 groups blocked. unblocked the
other 2."

Two of 89 people in the kept chats asked the AI to set up a printer with its
own bed size and were told to do it by hand.

